#. Translators: Please treat "Bazaar" and "BlankOn" as brand names and avoid translating.
#: src/bz-rebrand.c:65
msgid "Originally Bazaar, patched by BlankOn Linux"
msgstr "Dibangun dari Bazaar, dimodifikasi oleh BlankOn Linux"

#: data/id.blankonlinux.warsi.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Warsi is based on Bazaar and patched by BlankOn Linux. Besides Flatpak apps, "
"it also keeps the system's Debian APT packages up to date."
msgstr ""
"Warsi dibangun dari Bazaar dan dimodifikasi oleh BlankOn Linux. Selain "
"aplikasi Flatpak, Warsi juga menjaga paket APT Debian di sistem tetap "
"mutakhir."

#. Translators: Please treat "Warsi" as a brand name and avoid translating.
