msgid ""
"The Warsi logo is set in the Praise typeface by Robert Leuschke, licensed "
"under the <a href=\"https://openfontlicense.org\">SIL Open Font License, "
"Version 1.1</a>."
msgstr ""
"Logo Warsi menggunakan huruf Praise karya Robert Leuschke, dengan lisensi "
"<a href=\"https://openfontlicense.org\">SIL Open Font License, Versi 1.1</a>."
